# 11. Backend Routing

This is one of the most important requirements.

Each Assistant/Feature has its **own backend**.

Therefore, do not send every request to the IPRU GPT backend.

The frontend must determine the active context before making the API request.

### No selection

```text
User Prompt
    ↓
Normal IPRU GPT backend
```

### PMS Assist selected

```text
User Prompt
    ↓
PMS Assist backend
```

### PST Assist selected

```text
User Prompt
    ↓
PST Assist backend
```

### Chat with PDF selected

```text
User Prompt + PDF
    ↓
PDF backend
```

### Chat with Excel selected

```text
User Prompt + Excel
    ↓
Excel backend
```

Reuse the existing PMS Assist and PST Assist frontend API implementations to ensure the new page calls their backends correctly.

Do not guess or recreate their API contracts.

