# 20. Registry-Based Design

Do not implement:

```text
if command === "pms-assist"
...
else if command === "pst-assist"
...
else if command === "chat-with-pdf"
...
```

throughout multiple components.

Instead, create a centralized registry/configuration.

Conceptually:

```text
{
  id: "pms-assist",
  type: "assist",
  label: "PMS Assist",
  trigger: "/",
  description: "...",
  backend: "pms"
}
```

and:

```text
{
  id: "chat-with-pdf",
  type: "feature",
  label: "Chat with PDF",
  trigger: "@",
  description: "...",
  backend: "pdf"
}
```

This should make future additions straightforward.

