# 24. Command Menu UX Details

The command menu should:

* Open automatically when `/` or `@` is typed.
* Filter results as the user types.
* Highlight the active result.
* Support mouse selection.
* Support keyboard navigation.
* Support Enter.
* Support Tab.
* Support Escape.
* Position itself intelligently relative to the chat input.
* Not go outside the viewport.
* Close when selection is completed.
* Preserve the rest of the user's prompt.
* Avoid breaking cursor positioning.
* Correctly handle commands typed in the middle of a sentence.

Alphabetically sort matching results unless there is a stronger UX reason to prioritize exact/prefix matches.

Prefer:

```text
Exact/prefix match
    ↓
Relevant partial match
    ↓
Alphabetical order
```

